{"id":"817754b1-a526-48ea-afb6-3ed03afc6f30","type":"https://serlo.org/editor","variant":"serlo-org","domainOrigin":"serlo.org","version":2,"editorVersion":"0.22.0","dateModified":"2025-02-26T18:21:46.504Z","document":{"plugin":"exercise","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Ein Hotel verfügt über 105 Betten, die sich in 40 Zwei-bzw.-Dreibettzimmern befinden. Wie viele Zwei-und-Dreibettzimmer kann das Hotel vermieten?"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Löse mit einem Gleichungssystem!"}]}],"id":"501742ae-7341-435a-b86d-d6559a1f4f98"}],"id":"37dee50d-a2f1-4a50-a79a-f88f8070d444"},"solution":{"plugin":"solution","state":{"prerequisite":{"id":"1749","title":"Lineare Gleichungssysteme"},"strategy":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Erstelle aus dem Aufgabentext ein lineares Gleichungssystem."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Tipp: Wähle die Variable "},{"type":"math","src":"x","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x"}]},{"text":" für die Anzahl der Zweibettzimmer und die Variable "},{"type":"math","src":"y","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"y"}]},{"text":" für die  Anzahl der Dreibettzimmer."}]}],"id":"7c07ae1f-32b8-490a-89d4-30f5c3972f8c"},"steps":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Gleichungen aus dem Text aufstellen"}]}],"id":"8e55cdfb-f8db-4ebc-86ee-f0e1db5be1c0"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Was ist bekannt? Die Summe der Anzahl der Zweibettzimmer "},{"type":"math","src":"x","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x"}]},{"text":" und der Anzahl der Dreibettzimmer "},{"type":"math","src":"y","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"y"}]},{"text":" beträgt 40. Diese Aussage liefert dir Gleichung "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"I"}]},{"text":":"}]},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I}\quad x + y =40","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"6576bc1d-135f-418e-b877-7141d4477486"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"In einem Zweibettzimmer stehen zwei Betten. In "},{"type":"math","src":" x ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x"}]},{"text":" Zweibettzimmern stehen somit  "},{"type":"math","src":"2\cdot x
","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" Betten und entsprechend stehen in den Dreibettzimmern "},{"type":"math","src":"3\cdot x","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" Betten. Insgesamt hat das Hotel 105 Betten, so dass du Gleichung "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{II}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"II"}]},{"text":" aufstellen kannst:"}]},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{II} \quad 2x + 3y =105","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"dbd3b9d5-4760-49d4-b7e5-d2f50b9d3bc2"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Du hast nun folgendes lineare Gleichungssystem mit zwei Gleichungen und zwei Unbekannten erhalten:"}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{cl}
\mathrm{I}\quad x & + & y &  = & 40 & \\
\mathrm{II}\quad 2x & + & 3y & =& 105 
\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"d406d872-2f6a-4937-9154-eb8214952dae"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Gleichungssystem lösen"}]}],"id":"fa776449-8906-4b3e-bd02-d2fe88e6dec3"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Zur Lösung  dieses Gleichungssystems stehen dir drei Lösungsverfahren zur Verfügung:"}]},{"type":"unordered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"list-item-child","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"a","href":"/1735","children":[{"text":"Einsetzungsverfahren"}]},{"text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"list-item-child","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"a","href":"/1737","children":[{"text":"Gleichsetzungsverfahren"}]},{"text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"list-item-child","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"a","href":"/1661","children":[{"text":"Additionsverfahren"}]},{"text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Lösung mit dem Einsetzungsverfahren"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Löse Gleichung "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\mathrm{II}"}]},{"text":" nach einer der beiden Variablen auf und setze diese Variable in Gleichung "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{II}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\mathrm{II}"}]},{"text":" ein. Es spielt keine Rolle, ob du "},{"type":"math","src":" \mathrm{I}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\mathrm{II}"}]},{"text":" nach "},{"type":"math","src":"x","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x"}]},{"text":" oder "},{"type":"math","src":"y","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"y"}]},{"text":" auflöst. "}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I'}\quad y=40-x","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":". Eingesetzt in "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{II}:
","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\mathrm{II}"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}2\cdot x +3\cdot(40-x)&=&105&\vert\text{Klammer auflösen}\\\\2x+120-3x&=&105&\vert\text{zusammenfassen}\\\\-x+120&=&105&\vert-120\\\\-x&=&-15&\vert\cdot (-1)\\\\x&=&15\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"8e342186-55b8-4f04-84a2-8ce1c1d90eb8"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Setze "},{"type":"math","src":"x=15","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x=15"}]},{"text":" in Gleichung "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I'}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" ein: "},{"type":"math","src":"y=40-15=25","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"y=40-15=25"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Die Lösungsmenge deines Gleichungssystems lautet also :  "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathbb{L}=\{(15\vert 25)\}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"","strong":true}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Antwort:","strong":true},{"text":" Das Hotel verfügt über "},{"type":"math","src":"15 ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"15"}]},{"text":" Zweibettzimmer und über "},{"type":"math","src":"25","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"25"}]},{"text":" Dreibettzimmer."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Lösung mit dem Gleichsetzungsverfahren"}]}],"id":"0a807981-f531-4f66-8bb0-b647bcf7e97d"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Löse beide Gleichungen nach derselben Variablen auf. Du hast beim Einsetzungsverfahren schon Gleichung "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I} ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" nach "},{"type":"math","src":"y","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"y"}]},{"text":" aufgelöst."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I'}\quad y=40-x","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\mathrm{I'}\quad y=40-x"}]},{"text":". Nun muss Gleichung "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{II}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"\mathrm{I'}"}]},{"text":" auch nach "},{"type":"math","src":"y","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"y"}]},{"text":" aufgelöst werden:"}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}2\cdot x +3\cdot y&=&105&\vert-2 x\\\\3y&=&105-2x&\vert:3\\\\\mathrm{II'}\quad y&=&35-\dfrac{2}{3}x\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Setze nun die beiden rechten Seiten der Gleichungen "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I'}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" und "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{II'}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" gleich:"}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}40- x &=&35-\dfrac{2}{3}x&\vert+x\\\\40&=&35+\dfrac{1}{3}x&\vert-35\\\\5&=&\dfrac{1}{3}x&\vert\cdot3\\\\x&=&15\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Setze "},{"type":"math","src":"x=15","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x=15"}]},{"text":" in Gleichung "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I'}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" ein: "},{"type":"math","src":"y=40-15=25","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"y=40-15=25"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Die Lösungsmenge deines Gleichungssystems lautet also :  "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathbb{L}=\{(15\vert 25)\}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"","strong":true}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Antwort:","strong":true},{"text":" Das Hotel verfügt über "},{"type":"math","src":"15 ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"15"}]},{"text":" Zweibettzimmer und über "},{"type":"math","src":"25","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"25"}]},{"text":" Dreibettzimmer."}]}],"id":"da25d193-a98f-45e2-aa52-867b1e8a69bb"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Lösung mit dem Additionsverfahren"}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{cccccccl}
\mathrm{I}\quad x & + & y &  = & 40 & \\
\mathrm{II}\quad 2x & + & 3y & =& 105 
\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"b0ca0475-cf4a-49ce-88c4-25f74cb4dfc1"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Ziel ist es, dass sich durch Addition der beiden Gleichungen eine der unbekannten Größen aufhebt. In diesem Gleichungssystem kannst du z.B. die Gleichung "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I} ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" mit "},{"type":"math","src":"(-2)","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"(-2)"}]},{"text":" multiplizieren  "},{"type":"math","src":"\Rightarrow \mathrm{I'}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":". Durch Addition der beiden Gleichungen "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I'}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" und "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{II}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" erhältst du schon die Lösung für "},{"type":"math","src":" y","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"y"}]},{"text":":"}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{cl}
\mathrm{I'}\quad &-2x&  -  &2y & = & -80  \\\mathrm{II}\quad  &2x&  +  &3y & = & 105\\\mathrm{I'}+\mathrm{II}&0x&+&y&=&25\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"eac8bd80-7d34-4304-baa7-776ae3dc3265"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Setze "},{"type":"math","src":"y=25","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"x=15"}]},{"text":" in Gleichung "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathrm{I}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" ein: "},{"type":"math","src":"x+25=40\Rightarrow x=15","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"y=40-15=25"}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Die Lösungsmenge deines Gleichungssystems lautet also :  "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathbb{L}=\{(15\vert 25)\}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"","strong":true}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Antwort:","strong":true},{"text":" Das Hotel verfügt über "},{"type":"math","src":"15 ","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"15"}]},{"text":" Zweibettzimmer und über "},{"type":"math","src":"25","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"25"}]},{"text":" Dreibettzimmer."}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"00dee279-8982-4c88-a57c-a51f4f828ce9"},{"plugin":"spoiler","state":{"title":"Überprüfung (Probe)","content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Bei der Lösung von Gleichungssystemen bietet sich am Ende der Rechnung eine Probe an. In diesem Fall: In15 Zweibettzimmern stehen 30 Betten und in 25 Dreibettzimmern stehen 75 Betten. Die Summe der Betten ist "},{"type":"math","src":"30+75= 105","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"30+75= 105"}]},{"text":", wie in dem Aufgabentext angegeben. Die Zimmeranzahl beträgt "},{"type":"math","src":"15+25=40","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"15+25=40"}]},{"text":" und stimmt auch mit der Angabe im  Aufgabentext überein. Die angegebene Lösungsmenge ist also die Lösung des Gleichungssystems."}]}],"id":"5fe00260-03fc-460d-9950-37a2635b9813"}],"id":"747f7265-b9b5-4bc8-bf48-128050ecfb15"}},"id":"a4b85564-54b3-4fc9-b7c1-82bc79cc96f5"}],"id":"279d7080-1e21-420f-9172-1ce12e5bdeec"}},"id":"a931f5fb-2aaf-4c37-9976-265ab6259c4c"}},"id":"a1f62c83-a37e-43f2-adf2-60cd66a4aac9"}}
